{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-js","path":"/note-changebattery-x280-en","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"id":"f4347585-fe9c-523b-bf23-7dd3c50aeef8","html":"<blockquote>\n<p>This page has been machine-translated from the <a href=\"/note-changebattery-x280\">original page</a>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>This time, I replaced the battery in my <a href=\"https://www.lenovo.com/jp/ja/notebooks/thinkpad/x-series/ThinkPad-X280/p/22TP2TX2800\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">ThinkPad X280</a>, which I have been using for about four years, so I am summarizing the process here.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.lenovo.com/medias/lenovo-laptop-thinkpad-x280-feature-2.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfHJvb3R8OTI2MTV8aW1hZ2UvanBnfGgwMS9oMjgvOTYxNzc1MTA0ODIyMi5qcGd8MTZjMjJjZDc1ZWY4YjQyODkwYTUzMDZlYTg3NDg5ZGQ2YjQyYTU2YWU5ZWJkZWIzNWRkMjQ5NjNjMWEzMzY3Yg&#x26;w=1920\" alt=\"ThinkPad x280\"></p>\n<p>The actual replacement process only involves disabling the internal battery, removing it, and installing the new one, and it takes about five minutes.</p>\n<p>I will explain the details later in the article.</p>\n<!-- omit in toc -->\n<h2 id=\"table-of-contents\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#table-of-contents\" aria-label=\"table of contents permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Table of Contents</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#the-battery-has-reached-its-limit\">The Battery Has Reached Its Limit</a></li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#checking-battery-capacity-in-windows\">Checking Battery Capacity in Windows</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#check-battery-information-and-maximum-capacity\">Check Battery Information and Maximum Capacity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#recent-battery-usage\">Recent Battery Usage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#battery-usage-history\">Battery Usage History</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#identify-when-the-battery-started-to-degrade\">Identify When the Battery Started to Degrade</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#estimated-battery-life\">Estimated Battery Life</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#replacing-the-battery\">Replacing the Battery</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#battery-replacement-procedure\">Battery Replacement Procedure</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#disabling-the-internal-battery\">Disabling the Internal Battery</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#removing-the-bottom-cover\">Removing the Bottom Cover</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#removing-the-battery\">Removing the Battery</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#installing-the-battery\">Installing the Battery</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#verification\">Verification</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"#summary\">Summary</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"the-battery-has-reached-its-limit\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#the-battery-has-reached-its-limit\" aria-label=\"the battery has reached its limit permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>The Battery Has Reached Its Limit</h2>\n<p>Before writing about how to replace the battery, I want to record what led me to replace it.</p>\n<p>The X280 I currently use was purchased in a configuration with an <code class=\"language-text\">Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-8550U CPU</code> and <code class=\"language-text\">RAM 16GB</code> for about 100,000 yen, and I had used it for roughly four years as of January 8, 2022.</p>\n<p>The durable chassis still had almost no scratches even though I carried it with me almost every time I went out, and the keyboard also remained in very clean condition, perhaps because I cleaned it regularly.</p>\n<p>Because I had chosen the highest specification available at the time of purchase, it was still very much usable.</p>\n<p>However, around the end of 2021, when I was working on the PC outside, the battery suddenly started dropping rapidly once it went below around 30%, and the machine would shut down in about 15 minutes.</p>\n<p>As a result, it only ran for about two hours without being connected to power, which had become somewhat inconvenient.</p>\n<p>In practice, when going out I had reached the point where I could not do without a charger with an output of 30W or more like the one below, or a 25W mobile battery (with 25W, the ThinkPad X280 can charge slowly).</p>\n<p>Reference: <a href=\"https://amzn.to/3F0m3OE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Anker PowerPort III 2-Port 65W (USB PD charger, USB-C 2 ports)</a></p>\n<p>Reference: <a href=\"https://amzn.to/3q4D5qs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Anker PowerCore 10000 PD Redux 25W (mobile battery, 10000mAh, large capacity)</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"checking-battery-capacity-in-windows\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#checking-battery-capacity-in-windows\" aria-label=\"checking battery capacity in windows permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Checking Battery Capacity in Windows</h2>\n<p>If you are using Windows, you can launch Command Prompt as an administrator and run <code class=\"language-text\">powercfg/batteryreport</code> to generate a battery report at <code class=\"language-text\">C:/WINDOWS/system32/battery-report.html</code>.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"powershell\"><pre class=\"language-powershell\"><code class=\"language-powershell\"><span class=\"token comment\"># Launch Command Prompt as administrator</span>\npowercfg/batteryreport</code></pre></div>\n<p>This report contains information such as the following.</p>\n<h3 id=\"check-battery-information-and-maximum-capacity\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#check-battery-information-and-maximum-capacity\" aria-label=\"check battery information and maximum capacity permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Check Battery Information and Maximum Capacity</h3>\n<p>First, you can check the basic information.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 550px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/1e8f9f23a5e64f7898990e3dcb22509f/dd45a/image-9.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 119.16666666666667%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/1e8f9f23a5e64f7898990e3dcb22509f/8ac56/image-9.webp 240w,\n/static/1e8f9f23a5e64f7898990e3dcb22509f/d3be9/image-9.webp 480w,\n/static/1e8f9f23a5e64f7898990e3dcb22509f/12b65/image-9.webp 550w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 550px) 100vw, 550px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/1e8f9f23a5e64f7898990e3dcb22509f/8ff5a/image-9.png 240w,\n/static/1e8f9f23a5e64f7898990e3dcb22509f/e85cb/image-9.png 480w,\n/static/1e8f9f23a5e64f7898990e3dcb22509f/dd45a/image-9.png 550w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 550px) 100vw, 550px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/1e8f9f23a5e64f7898990e3dcb22509f/dd45a/image-9.png\"\n            alt=\"image-9.png\"\n            title=\"image-9.png\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>If you want to check how much the battery has degraded, look at [DESIGN CAPACITY] and [FULL CHARGE CAPACITY].</p>\n<p>[DESIGN CAPACITY] is the battery’s theoretical maximum capacity, and [FULL CHARGE CAPACITY] is the actual maximum capacity when it is charged.</p>\n<p>Because the image above was taken after replacing the battery, the values of [DESIGN CAPACITY] and [FULL CHARGE CAPACITY] are the same. If the battery is degraded, the value of [FULL CHARGE CAPACITY] becomes smaller.</p>\n<p>In fact, before replacement, the battery’s [FULL CHARGE CAPACITY] had dropped to around 30% of [DESIGN CAPACITY].</p>\n<h3 id=\"recent-battery-usage\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#recent-battery-usage\" aria-label=\"recent battery usage permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Recent Battery Usage</h3>\n<p>Next, you can check battery usage over the past three days.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 772px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/077b5e651ad6d8169e78901472f8d6d4/940c5/image-10.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 45.416666666666664%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/077b5e651ad6d8169e78901472f8d6d4/8ac56/image-10.webp 240w,\n/static/077b5e651ad6d8169e78901472f8d6d4/d3be9/image-10.webp 480w,\n/static/077b5e651ad6d8169e78901472f8d6d4/ca172/image-10.webp 772w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 772px) 100vw, 772px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/077b5e651ad6d8169e78901472f8d6d4/8ff5a/image-10.png 240w,\n/static/077b5e651ad6d8169e78901472f8d6d4/e85cb/image-10.png 480w,\n/static/077b5e651ad6d8169e78901472f8d6d4/940c5/image-10.png 772w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 772px) 100vw, 772px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/077b5e651ad6d8169e78901472f8d6d4/940c5/image-10.png\"\n            alt=\"image-10.png\"\n            title=\"image-10.png\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 872px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/02955bdeef8a03c5fc2458d16b12937b/65654/image-11.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 69.58333333333333%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/02955bdeef8a03c5fc2458d16b12937b/8ac56/image-11.webp 240w,\n/static/02955bdeef8a03c5fc2458d16b12937b/d3be9/image-11.webp 480w,\n/static/02955bdeef8a03c5fc2458d16b12937b/a8a2c/image-11.webp 872w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 872px) 100vw, 872px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/02955bdeef8a03c5fc2458d16b12937b/8ff5a/image-11.png 240w,\n/static/02955bdeef8a03c5fc2458d16b12937b/e85cb/image-11.png 480w,\n/static/02955bdeef8a03c5fc2458d16b12937b/65654/image-11.png 872w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 872px) 100vw, 872px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/02955bdeef8a03c5fc2458d16b12937b/65654/image-11.png\"\n            alt=\"image-11.png\"\n            title=\"image-11.png\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The record for 1/6 is the log from before the battery replacement, and it shows that starting from an almost full charge at 14:29, the remaining charge suddenly dropped to 35% in about one hour and thirty minutes.</p>\n<h3 id=\"battery-usage-history\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#battery-usage-history\" aria-label=\"battery usage history permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Battery Usage History</h3>\n<p>You can also check battery usage over a somewhat longer period.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 907px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/e12f34b6719ec20f5760560ede7ae28b/142fb/image-12.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 69.16666666666667%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/e12f34b6719ec20f5760560ede7ae28b/8ac56/image-12.webp 240w,\n/static/e12f34b6719ec20f5760560ede7ae28b/d3be9/image-12.webp 480w,\n/static/e12f34b6719ec20f5760560ede7ae28b/468b0/image-12.webp 907w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 907px) 100vw, 907px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/e12f34b6719ec20f5760560ede7ae28b/8ff5a/image-12.png 240w,\n/static/e12f34b6719ec20f5760560ede7ae28b/e85cb/image-12.png 480w,\n/static/e12f34b6719ec20f5760560ede7ae28b/142fb/image-12.png 907w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 907px) 100vw, 907px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/e12f34b6719ec20f5760560ede7ae28b/142fb/image-12.png\"\n            alt=\"image-12.png\"\n            title=\"image-12.png\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>[BATTERY DURATION] indicates how long the PC was running on battery power, and [AC DURATION] indicates how long it was running while connected to power.</p>\n<h3 id=\"identify-when-the-battery-started-to-degrade\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#identify-when-the-battery-started-to-degrade\" aria-label=\"identify when the battery started to degrade permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Identify When the Battery Started to Degrade</h3>\n<p>Next, you can also check changes in battery capacity.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 558px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/958f784155f879cc815271b55452c0a3/42a8d/image-13.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 107.5%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/958f784155f879cc815271b55452c0a3/8ac56/image-13.webp 240w,\n/static/958f784155f879cc815271b55452c0a3/d3be9/image-13.webp 480w,\n/static/958f784155f879cc815271b55452c0a3/1c397/image-13.webp 558w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 558px) 100vw, 558px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/958f784155f879cc815271b55452c0a3/8ff5a/image-13.png 240w,\n/static/958f784155f879cc815271b55452c0a3/e85cb/image-13.png 480w,\n/static/958f784155f879cc815271b55452c0a3/42a8d/image-13.png 558w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 558px) 100vw, 558px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/958f784155f879cc815271b55452c0a3/42a8d/image-13.png\"\n            alt=\"image-13.png\"\n            title=\"image-13.png\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>In the image above, you can see that [FULL CHARGE CAPACITY] dropped sharply around the end of 2021, when I started to notice the battery degradation.</p>\n<p>I do not know the reason, but perhaps it was simply the end of its life.</p>\n<h3 id=\"estimated-battery-life\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#estimated-battery-life\" aria-label=\"estimated battery life permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Estimated Battery Life</h3>\n<p>Finally, the report outputs an estimate of battery runtime.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 890px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/f726f08a94253052bac3a6c0ea2f655a/4ef49/image-14.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 76.25%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/f726f08a94253052bac3a6c0ea2f655a/8ac56/image-14.webp 240w,\n/static/f726f08a94253052bac3a6c0ea2f655a/d3be9/image-14.webp 480w,\n/static/f726f08a94253052bac3a6c0ea2f655a/8d1ba/image-14.webp 890w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 890px) 100vw, 890px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/f726f08a94253052bac3a6c0ea2f655a/8ff5a/image-14.png 240w,\n/static/f726f08a94253052bac3a6c0ea2f655a/e85cb/image-14.png 480w,\n/static/f726f08a94253052bac3a6c0ea2f655a/4ef49/image-14.png 890w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 890px) 100vw, 890px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/f726f08a94253052bac3a6c0ea2f655a/4ef49/image-14.png\"\n            alt=\"image-14.png\"\n            title=\"image-14.png\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>It estimated roughly 90 minutes to two hours, which matched my own experience.</p>\n<h2 id=\"replacing-the-battery\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#replacing-the-battery\" aria-label=\"replacing the battery permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Replacing the Battery</h2>\n<p>So, although I still do not know the reason, it became clear that the ThinkPad battery had degraded badly, so I replaced it.</p>\n<p>Unfortunately, I could not get a genuine replacement battery, so I bought a compatible one on Amazon.</p>\n<p>Reference: <a href=\"https://amzn.to/32TiQDF\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">【NOTEPARTS】Lenovo ThinkPad battery for A285/X280, compatible with 01AV470 / 01AV471 / 01AV472</a></p>\n<p>The purchase price was 7,980 yen.</p>\n<p>Honestly, I will not know about the quality until I use it, but it came with a one-year warranty from the purchase date and a PSE mark, so I figured it probably would not catch fire.</p>\n<h3 id=\"battery-replacement-procedure\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#battery-replacement-procedure\" aria-label=\"battery replacement procedure permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Battery Replacement Procedure</h3>\n<p>The battery replacement procedure for the ThinkPad X280 is very simple.</p>\n<p>It took about five minutes in total.</p>\n<p>At a high level, the procedure is as follows.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Disable the internal battery</li>\n<li>Remove the bottom cover</li>\n<li>Remove the battery</li>\n<li>Install the battery</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If you watch the official Lenovo video for each step, you will understand it perfectly.</p>\n<p>Honestly, it is so simple that you will probably understand it even without watching the video.</p>\n<p>Reference: <a href=\"https://support.lenovo.com/jp/ja/solutions/ht510682-removal-and-replacement-videos-thinkpad-x280-20ke-20kf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Removal and replacement videos - ThinkPad X280 (20KE, 20KF) - Lenovo Support JP</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"disabling-the-internal-battery\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#disabling-the-internal-battery\" aria-label=\"disabling the internal battery permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Disabling the Internal Battery</h3>\n<p>First, disable the internal battery.</p>\n<p>This is something you should always do when removing parts from a ThinkPad.</p>\n<p>Even if you accidentally forget, it will not immediately cause a failure (speaking from experience), but make sure to disable it every time.</p>\n<p>The procedure is simple: after starting the BIOS with the F1 key, go to [Config] > [Power] and select the option to disable the internal battery.</p>\n<p>This will automatically turn off the PC and allow you to remove the parts.</p>\n<p>For details, see the [Disable Built-in Battery] section of the video mentioned earlier.</p>\n<h3 id=\"removing-the-bottom-cover\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#removing-the-bottom-cover\" aria-label=\"removing the bottom cover permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Removing the Bottom Cover</h3>\n<p>I will omit the details.</p>\n<p>Just remove the screws.</p>\n<p>On some other ThinkPad models, you need a tool to release the clips when removing the bottom cover, but the X280 does not require any special tools and can be removed easily.</p>\n<h3 id=\"removing-the-battery\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#removing-the-battery\" aria-label=\"removing the battery permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Removing the Battery</h3>\n<p>Remove the screws and lift the battery upward.</p>\n<p>If you watch the [Removing the Built-in Battery] part of the video, you will understand it immediately.</p>\n<p>After removing it, it looks like this.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 450px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/da6fd6f1f0a1ce38e927fc4d689509e5/20e5d/IMG_0008.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.33333333333331%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/da6fd6f1f0a1ce38e927fc4d689509e5/8ac56/IMG_0008.webp 240w,\n/static/da6fd6f1f0a1ce38e927fc4d689509e5/8626f/IMG_0008.webp 450w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 450px) 100vw, 450px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/da6fd6f1f0a1ce38e927fc4d689509e5/09b79/IMG_0008.jpg 240w,\n/static/da6fd6f1f0a1ce38e927fc4d689509e5/20e5d/IMG_0008.jpg 450w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 450px) 100vw, 450px\"\n            type=\"image/jpeg\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/da6fd6f1f0a1ce38e927fc4d689509e5/20e5d/IMG_0008.jpg\"\n            alt=\"IMG_0008.jpg\"\n            title=\"IMG_0008.jpg\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<h3 id=\"installing-the-battery\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#installing-the-battery\" aria-label=\"installing the battery permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Installing the Battery</h3>\n<p>Do the reverse of the removal process.</p>\n<p>It fit a little more loosely than the genuine battery, which made me somewhat uneasy, but it did not seem to cause any problems.</p>\n<h3 id=\"verification\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#verification\" aria-label=\"verification permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Verification</h3>\n<p>Finally, turn the power on and check the battery status in the battery report, and you are done.</p>\n<p>This gave my ThinkPad X280 a longer life.</p>\n<h2 id=\"summary\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#summary\" aria-label=\"summary permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Summary</h2>\n<p>I replaced the battery in the X280, which I had used for about four years, to extend its life.</p>\n<p>It still looks like it will remain perfectly usable for a while.</p>\n<p>(Lately I have been curious about the ThinkPad X1 Nano Gen2, though…)</p>","fields":{"slug":"/note-changebattery-x280-en","tagSlugs":["/tag/think-pad/","/tag/english/"]},"frontmatter":{"date":"2022-01-08","description":"","tags":["ThinkPad","English"],"title":"How to Check the Battery Report in Windows and Extend the Life of a ThinkPad X280 by Replacing Its Battery","socialImage":{"publicURL":"/static/6a530e6b21eb4453e483b26bda87dbaa/note-changebattery-x280.png"}}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/note-changebattery-x280-en"}},"staticQueryHashes":["251939775","401334301","825871152"]}